msgstr "Aquesta visita vs l’adreça desada"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:251
msgid "The way you opened this page matches the saved public address (http or https)."
msgstr "La manera com has obert aquesta pàgina coincideix amb l’adreça pública desada (http o https)."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:252
msgid "You opened this page with a different padlock setting than the address WordPress has saved. Logins and cookies often break in that case."
msgstr "Has obert aquesta pàgina amb un cadenat diferent del que WordPress té desat. En aquests casos sovint fallen l’inici de sessió i les galetes."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:255
msgid "Always open the admin using the same https/www form as Settings → General."
msgstr "Obre sempre l’admin amb la mateixa forma https/www que a Paràmetres → General."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:261
msgid "www vs without www"
msgstr "www vs sense www"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:265
msgid "Both addresses use www."
msgstr "Totes dues adreces fan servir www."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:266
msgid "Both addresses skip www."
msgstr "Totes dues adreces van sense www."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:268
msgid "One address uses www and the other does not. That usually causes extra redirects or mixed cookies."
msgstr "Una adreça fa servir www i l’altra no. Això sol provocar redireccions de més o galetes barrejades."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:271
msgid "Pick one form (with or without www) and keep it everywhere, including Search & Replace if needed."
msgstr "Tria una forma (amb www o sense) i mantén-la a tot arreu, també a Cercar i substituir si cal."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:277
msgid "Folder in the address"
msgstr "Carpeta a l’adreça"

#. translators: 1: home path, 2: site path
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:281
#, php-format
msgid "Public path: %1$s. WordPress path: %2$s. This is normal when WordPress lives in a subfolder."
msgstr "Camí públic: %1$s. Camí de WordPress: %2$s. És normal si WordPress viu en una subcarpeta."

#. translators: %s: URL path
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:287
#, php-format
msgid "Both addresses use the path %s."
msgstr "Totes dues adreces fan servir el camí %s."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:295
msgid "Force HTTPS for wp-admin"
msgstr "Força HTTPS a wp-admin"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:297
msgid "FORCE_SSL_ADMIN is on. The dashboard should only load over https."
msgstr "FORCE_SSL_ADMIN està actiu. L’escriptori només hauria de carregar-se amb https."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:298
msgid "FORCE_SSL_ADMIN is not on. That is fine if the whole site already uses https."
msgstr "FORCE_SSL_ADMIN no està actiu. Està bé si tot el web ja fa servir https."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:307
msgid "Locked in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Blocat a wp-config.php"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:308
msgid "WP_HOME and/or WP_SITEURL are defined in wp-config.php, so Settings → General cannot change those addresses. This plugin never edits that file."
msgstr "WP_HOME i/o WP_SITEURL estan definits a wp-config.php, així que Paràmetres → General no pot canviar aquestes adreces. Aquest plugin no edita mai aquest fitxer."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:309
msgid "If the constants are wrong after a move, edit wp-config.php on the server (or ask hosting)."
msgstr "Si les constants són incorrectes després d’un canvi, edita wp-config.php al servidor (o demana-ho a l’allotjament)."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:371
#, php-format
msgid "This site answered with status %d. The public address looks reachable from the server."
msgstr "Aquest web ha respost amb l’estat %d. L’adreça pública sembla accessible des del servidor."

#. translators: %s: final URL host
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:377
#, php-format
msgid "The request ended on a different domain (%s). Check redirects, CDN, or a leftover old address."
msgstr "La petició ha acabat en un altre domini (%s). Revisa redireccions, CDN o una adreça antiga que hagi quedat."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:383
#, php-format
msgid "The public address answered with status %d. That is not a normal success page."
msgstr "L’adreça pública ha respost amb l’estat %d. No és una pàgina d’èxit normal."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:421
msgid "This screen explains whether the two addresses WordPress has saved still match how you open the site (https, www, folder). It does not change the database. Use Search & Replace only after you know the correct address."
msgstr "Aquesta pantalla explica si les dues adreces que WordPress té desades encara coincideixen amb com obres el web (https, www, carpeta). No canvia la base de dades. Fes servir Cercar i substituir només quan sàpigues l’adreça correcta."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:425
msgid "Addresses WordPress has saved"
msgstr "Adreces que WordPress té desades"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:428
msgid "Public site (Home)"
msgstr "Web públic (Home)"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:432
msgid "WordPress address (Site URL)"
msgstr "Adreça de WordPress (Site URL)"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:439
msgid "What we found"
msgstr "Què hem trobat"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:444
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Resultat"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:445
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "Què vol dir"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:466
msgid "Can the server reach its own public page?"
msgstr "El servidor pot arribar a la seva pàgina pública?"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:468
msgid "Optional. Only runs when you click the button. It asks this site’s own home address from the server (the same idea as Site Health). No other website is contacted."
msgstr "Opcional. Només s’executa quan cliques el botó. El servidor pregunta a la pròpia adreça d’inici d’aquest web (la mateixa idea que Salut del lloc). No es contacta cap altre web."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:472
msgid "Check this site"
msgstr "Comprova aquest web"

#: includes/class-tsosk-admin.php:193
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:323
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:480
msgid "Needs attention"
msgstr "Cal revisar-ho"

#: includes/class-tsosk-admin.php:191
msgid "Clear the staging mail log? This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Vols buidar el registre de correus del mode prova? Aquesta acció no es pot desfer."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:264
msgid "post_max_size is smaller than upload_max_filesize, so large uploads can fail even when the file-size limit looks high enough."
msgstr "post_max_size és més petit que upload_max_filesize, així que les pujades grans poden fallar encara que el límit de mida de fitxer sembli suficient."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:298
msgid "WordPress timezone"
msgstr "Zona horària de WordPress"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:301
msgid "From Settings → General. WordPress keeps PHP on UTC internally, so a PHP timezone of UTC is normal."
msgstr "De Paràmetres → General. WordPress deixa PHP en UTC internament, així que una zona horària PHP d’UTC és normal."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:305
msgid "PHP vs database clock"
msgstr "Rellotge de PHP i de la base de dades"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:308
msgid "Could not read the database clock."
msgstr "No s’ha pogut llegir el rellotge de la base de dades."

#. translators: %d: seconds of difference
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "PHP and MySQL differ by %d seconds."
msgstr "PHP i MySQL tenen una diferència de %d segons."

#. translators: %d: seconds of difference
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:329
#, php-format
msgid "PHP and MySQL clocks differ by %d seconds. Scheduled posts and cron times can look wrong."
msgstr "Els rellotges de PHP i MySQL tenen una diferència de %d segons. Les publicacions programades i el cron poden mostrar hores incorrectes."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:440
msgid "Adds noindex headers, pauses XML sitemaps, and disallows crawling in robots.txt while this option is on. It does not change Settings → Reading."
msgstr "Afegeix capçaleres noindex, pausa els sitemaps XML i impedeix el rastreig a robots.txt mentre aquesta opció està activa. No canvia Paràmetres → Lectura."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:389
msgid "The first request failed a certificate check; the retry skipped TLS verification (typical on local or self-signed sites)."
msgstr "La primera petició ha fallat la comprovació del certificat; el reintent ha omès la verificació TLS (habitual en llocs locals o amb certificat auto-signat)."
